# Generated by build.py -- the whole site, the three PDFs, the TeX it went
# through, and the flat preview. Nothing in here is source, and nothing
# edited in here survives the next build. It is also 157M, most of the tree.
build/

# Deploy artefacts, built from the sources rather than from build/. Keeping
# them out is deliberate: a ZIP that was built, sent and never extracted
# looks exactly like work that was done, and that has already cost a day
# once. Rebuild them at deploy time instead of trusting one on disk.
learn_symbulator_com.zip
symbulator_com_landing.zip

# Python leftovers
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Editor and OS noise
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*~

# The three illustrated thesis editions are built from the Book source by
# thesis_circuits/build_thesis_pdfs.py. They are output: rebuild rather
# than trust one on disk.
paper/build_thesis/
